      "description": {
        "en": "After Archer uses his Skill \"Caladbolg II: Fake Spiral Sword\" to attack, if Skill Points are #3[i] or fewer or if \"Caladbolg II: Fake Spiral Sword\" has been actively used 5 times during the current \"Circuit Connection\" state, and the Joint Follow-Up ATK from \"Freeform Tohsaka Style\" has not been triggered, Rin Tohsaka and Archer will launch Joint Follow-Up ATK on all enemies, dealing Quantum DMG equal to #1[i]% of Rin Tohsaka's ATK and #4[i]% of Archer's ATK respectively, and recovering #2[i] Skill Point(s) for allies. This Joint Follow-Up ATK can only trigger once. The trigger count resets when Rin Tohsaka's turn ends.",
